# Single source of truth for pinned tool + dependency versions LOCAL to this
# package. Sourced by the scripts that need them — bump in ONE place, never
# inline. Plain `KEY="value"` so it's both shell-sourceable and greppable.
#
#   source "$(dirname "$0")/versions.env"
#
# Every entry here is a pinned tool/binary specific to pdf_manipulator's native
# + wasm build or its own platform gate. The GENERIC CI pins (fvm, Chrome,
# bore, and the zizmor + actionlint gate versions) moved to whuppi/ci — the
# shared capabilities + reusable pr-checks carry them from whuppi/ci's own
# versions.env, so they no longer live here.
# Facts about the subject being built (the pdf_oxide crate, its base tag, its
# features) live in build.json instead.
#
# Who bumps what:
#   tool/ci/upgrade.sh (daily PR) — the local pins in this file:
#       PANA_VERSION.
#   whuppi/ci self-upgrade — the shared pins, reaching this repo through a
#       whuppi/ci release + the grouped whuppi-ci Dependabot PR.
#   the shared upgrade-check   — the Flutter SDK in .fvmrc + the lockfiles.
#   Dependabot                 — pub deps + GitHub-action SHAs.

# pana — pub.dev's own analyzer, run by the `platforms` make target + CI job to
# gate that the package still resolves to all 6 pub.dev platforms. `dart pub
# global activate` resolves it from pub.dev (own integrity), so no sha is
# tracked. Bumped by tool/ci/upgrade.sh to pub.dev's LATEST: the gate must run
# the same pana pub.dev runs, or it drifts from the verdict it exists to predict.
PANA_VERSION="0.23.14"
